WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.227
Modularity works best when each layer has one responsibility.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:07.530
Base tables store source facts.

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.890
A shared view can own stable relational logic.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:19.180
A report-level common table expression can own a temporary threshold, ranking rule, or sequence calculation.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.590
The final query produces the consumer-specific result.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:27.701
This separation makes each layer easier to test and change.
